<mj-text font-size="22px" line-height="30px" font-weight="bold" color="#0b0b0f">You have been invited</mj-text>
<mj-text>Hello,</mj-text>
<mj-text>{{inviterName}} has invited you to join the "{{orgName}}" organization on ilovelawyer as a {{role}}.</mj-text>
<mj-text>Log in and accept the invite from your Organization page to get access.</mj-text>
<mj-button href="{{loginLink}}">Log in</mj-button>
<mj-text>Or copy and paste this link: {{loginLink}}</mj-text>
